  "description": "Basement excavation with front and rear lightwell; erection of a ground floor rear extension with sukkah roof; part first floor rear extension; front and rear dormer roof extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed front lightwell, by reason of its excessive size and overall depth, results in the loss of over half the front garden and, as such, has a harmful impact on the appearance of the property and the street scene. As such, the proposal fails to comply with policies D1 (London’s form, character and capacity for growth), D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and Hackney&#39;s Residential Alterations and Extensions SPD (2009). ",
    "The proposed front lightwell, by reason of its size and depth, results in the loss of over 50% of the front garden area, resulting in a harmful impact on the character and appearance of the host property and the terrace it forms part of.&nbsp; As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), policy LP1 and LP17 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020), and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009). "
  ],
